{"text":"My name is Mamea Bwafo, and I am an actor. Now, honestly, it hasn't been that long ago since I started introducing myself as one. Being an artist from an African upbringing, you know how it goes when you approach family to say you want to pursue this. For me, some of the responses I would get was, oh, okay, so what are you really studying in school, though? We hear about the acting, but what is your real degree? Or I would get, oh, Mamea, eh, nade? How? Why? Are you trying to tell me that you want to America to study acting, theater? Oh, oh, eh, lawyer, doctor, eh, this is hobby, hobby.","words":[{"text":"My","start":0.66,"end":1.1},{"text":"name","start":1.1,"end":1.28},{"text":"is","start":1.28,"end":1.48},{"text":"Mamea","start":1.48,"end":1.98},{"text":"Bwafo","start":1.98,"end":2.56,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":2.82,"end":3.08},{"text":"I","start":3.08,"end":3.36},{"text":"am","start":3.36,"end":3.52},{"text":"an","start":3.52,"end":3.7},{"text":"actor","start":3.7,"end":4.04,"punct":"."},{"text":"Now","start":5.46,"end":5.5,"punct":","},{"text":"honestly","start":5.56,"end":5.96,"punct":","},{"text":"it","start":6.22,"end":6.38},{"text":"hasn't","start":6.38,"end":6.6},{"text":"been","start":6.6,"end":6.78},{"text":"that","start":6.78,"end":7.04},{"text":"long","start":7.04,"end":7.34},{"text":"ago","start":7.34,"end":7.66},{"text":"since","start":7.66,"end":7.9},{"text":"I","start":7.9,"end":8.08},{"text":"started","start":8.08,"end":8.28},{"text":"introducing","start":8.28,"end":8.68},{"text":"myself","start":8.68,"end":9.1},{"text":"as","start":9.1,"end":9.32},{"text":"one","start":9.32,"end":9.64,"punct":"."},{"text":"Being","start":10.68,"end":10.9},{"text":"an","start":10.9,"end":11.16},{"text":"artist","start":11.16,"end":11.72},{"text":"from","start":11.72,"end":12.2},{"text":"an","start":12.2,"end":12.36},{"text":"African","start":12.36,"end":12.82},{"text":"upbringing","start":12.82,"end":14.02,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":14.42,